lse, so the conclusion (bear chases the bald eagle) is not triggered.\nThe statement is either explicitly supported or contradicted by the given information.Therefore, it is known.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]  0%|          | 2/600 [00:09<46:56,  4.71s/it]
