at he is not white, otherwise it\'s unknown. \n\nIn logic, unless there\'s a rule that explicitly states he isn\'t white, or that being white would lead to a contradiction, we can\'t conclude it\'s true. Since there\'s no such contradiction, the correct answer is that it\'s unknown. Therefore, I think the answer is C.\n</think>I am not sure.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
